<title>SWEDEN: Stena sees better '97 even without P&amp;O.</title>
<headline>Stena sees better '97 even without P&amp;O.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish ferry operator Stena Line AB said on Monday it expected an improved result in 1997 even if the planned joint venture with Britain's Peninsular &amp; Oriental Steam Navigation Co did not take place.</p>
</text>
